{
	"info": {
		"name": "NADIhatIMAN Wedding Planner",
		"description": "API collection for the NADIhatIMAN wedding planner app (Next.js + MongoDB + Clerk).\n\n## Authentication\nThe app uses Clerk. The API routes under `/api/*` read the Clerk session cookie, so in Postman you must send the same cookies a signed-in browser sends. Easiest way: sign in at {{baseUrl}}/sign-in, copy the `Cookie` request header value from your browser's DevTools (Network tab → any /api request), and paste it into the `authCookie` collection variable.\n\nPermissions:\n- `edit_guests` — guests + guest-inviters write endpoints\n- `edit_checklist` — checklist write endpoints\n- `edit_schedule` — settings, home-content, home-images\n- `edit_budget` — budget/settings sheet URL\n- superadmin — accounts + preparation\n\n## Guests\nGuest fields: `name`, `event` (nikah|sanding|tandang), `side` (bride|groom), `pax`, `phone`, `note`, `status` (dijemput|disahkan|tidak_hadir), `invitedBy` (free-text label of who invited them, e.g. \"Abah's invitation\"), `category` (free-text label of the guest's category, e.g. \"Family\", \"Friends\", \"VIP\").\n\n## Guest option lists (inviters & categories)\nInviters are the \"invited by\" options. Categories are OWNED BY an inviter (`categories.owner` stores the inviter's name) — e.g. \"Eiman → BSN\". Guests store the option's *name*, so:\n- PATCH (rename) cascades the new name to every guest using it.\n- DELETE unassigns guests that referenced it (field → \"\") but does NOT delete the guests.\n- Deleting an INVITER also deletes its owned categories (after unassigning them from guests).\n- Renaming an INVITER also renames the owner stored on its categories.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:3000"
		},
		{
			"key": "authCookie",
			"value": "__client_uat=1; __session=YOUR_CLERK_SESSION_COOKIE",
			"description": "Copy the full Cookie header from a signed-in browser request. Required for all write endpoints."
		},
		{
			"key": "guestId",
			"value": "REPLACE_WITH_GUEST_ID"
		},
		{
			"key": "inviterId",
			"value": "REPLACE_WITH_INVITER_ID"
		},
		{
			"key": "categoryId",
			"value": "REPLACE_WITH_CATEGORY_ID"
		},
		{
			"key": "checklistId",
			"value": "REPLACE_WITH_CHECKLIST_ID"
		},
		{
			"key": "accountId",
			"value": "REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID"
		},
		{
			"key": "preparationId",
			"value": "REPLACE_WITH_PREPARATION_ID"
		}
	],
	"auth": {
		"type": "apikey",
		"apikey": [
			{
				"key": "value",
				"value": "{{authCookie}}",
				"type": "string"
			},
			{
				"key": "key",
				"value": "Cookie",
				"type": "string"
			},
			{
				"key": "in",
				"value": "header",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Me",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get my permissions",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/me",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "me"]
						},
						"description": "Returns { signedIn, email, isSuperadmin, permissions } for the current Clerk session."
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Guests",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "List guests",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "guests"]
						},
						"description": "Returns { guests: [...] } sorted by createdAt. No permission needed."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Add guest",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Keluarga Hj. Ahmad\",\n  \"event\": \"sanding\",\n  \"side\": \"groom\",\n  \"invitedBy\": \"Abah's invitation\",\n  \"category\": \"Family\",\n  \"pax\": 4,\n  \"phone\": \"0123456789\",\n  \"note\": \"\",\n  \"status\": \"dijemput\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "guests"]
						},
						"description": "Requires edit_guests. `invitedBy` and `category` are optional (\"\" = unassigned). Returns 201 { guest }."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Bulk import guests (Canva CSV rows)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"guests\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Keluarga Hj. Ahmad\",\n      \"event\": \"sanding\",\n      \"side\": \"groom\",\n      \"invitedBy\": \"Abah's invitation\",\n      \"category\": \"Family\",\n      \"pax\": 4,\n      \"phone\": \"0123456789\",\n      \"note\": \"\",\n      \"status\": \"dijemput\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Puan Aminah\",\n      \"event\": \"nikah\",\n      \"side\": \"bride\",\n      \"invitedBy\": \"Mama's invitation\",\n      \"category\": \"Friends\",\n      \"pax\": 2,\n      \"phone\": \"\",\n      \"note\": \"\",\n      \"status\": \"disahkan\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "guests"]
						},
						"description": "Requires edit_guests. Send { guests: [...] } to insert many at once (used by the Canva CSV import). Returns 201 { guests, inserted }."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Update guest",
					"request": {
						"method": "PATCH",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"invitedBy\": \"Mama's invitation\",\n  \"category\": \"VIP\",\n  \"status\": \"disahkan\",\n  \"pax\": 5\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests/:id",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "guests", ":id"],
							"variable": [
								{
									"key": "id",
									"value": "{{guestId}}"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Requires edit_guests. Any subset of fields can be sent: name, event, side, invitedBy, category, pax, phone, note, status. Send invitedBy/category: \"\" to unassign. Returns { ok: true }."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Delete guest",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests/:id",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "guests", ":id"],
							"variable": [
								{
									"key": "id",
									"value": "{{guestId}}"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Requires edit_guests. Returns { ok: true }."
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Guest Inviters",
			"item": [
